    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My Wife&quot; is a desktop simulation game featuring an adorable character living on your computer screen. Position her anywhere, watch her dynamically interact with your desktop environment, and enjoy delightful companionship with fresh interactive experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Freely drag, rotate, and scale your character<br>\u2022 Import local custom models (supports VRM formats 0.x and 1.0) to create your own unique desktop companion<br>\u2022 Steam Workshop support - share your mods with others or download creations from the community<br>\u2022 Built-in Pomodoro Timer for focused work/study sessions<br>\u2022 Multi-monitor switching support</p>",
